{{ArcaneBox|name={{PAGENAME}}}}'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] for [[Warframes]] that locks a Warframe's [[Ability Efficiency]] at up to 175% when creating an object using a Warframe ability.

==Effect==
{| class="emodtable"
|-
! Rank
! Ability Efficiency Locked At
|-
| 0 || 125%
|-
| 1 || 135%
|-
| 2 || 145%
|-
| 3 || 155%
|-
| 4 || 165%
|-
| 5 || 175%
|-
|}

{{Acquisition|name={{PAGENAME}}}}

Can be bought from [[Hunhow]] at [[Pontis Tower]] for 10 {{Resource|Emerald Talent}} and 10 {{Resource|Crimson Talent}}

==Notes==
*Ability Efficiency is <u>locked at</u> ''(not increased by)'' the stated value when the Arcane activates.
**It will provide no benefit if the default efficiency is equal to the Arcane's effect.
**It will reduce efficiency if the default efficiency is higher than the Arcane's effect.
***This can normally only happen if the arcane is not at max rank. Otherwise, Arcane Sculptor provides the max amount of Ability Efficiency possible (outside of [[Lohk Surge]] buffs).
***Channeled abilities use both [[Ability Duration]] and Ability Efficiency to calculate their energy drain over time. If your Duration is below 100% and your  Efficiency is over 175% (this will still be displayed as 175%, but the excess is taken into account for channeled abilities), Arcane Sculptor will increase the drain over time of channeled abilities when it activates.
